# Tool caches -- excluded today only because ruff/mypy/pytest each write
# their own internal "*" ignore file into these dirs at runtime. Listed
# explicitly so a tool version that stops doing that (or a deleted cache)
# can't get one of these accidentally committed via `git add -A`.
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/

# One-off generated HTML review/audit reports (fonts, chart libs, zipped
# bundles) -- deliverables from a point-in-time review, not source. See
# the 2026-07-28 engineering inspection for why these keep recurring.
.trae-html-share-packages/
uiux-review/
codeagent-audit-report/

# Other agent tools keep private working notes inside the repo; they are
# local scratch, not project files.
.workbuddy/
